"""Three further test solutions; source statements only."""
import json
from pathlib import Path
ANSWERS=[
('2030/E','For any multiset its optimal score is sum over v>=0 of min(count[0],...,count[v]): make that many groups contain every value through v. For each prefix v and threshold k, the number of subsequences with every prefix count at least k is the product of binomial tails T(cnt[i],k); values beyond v can be chosen freely, giving factor 2^(remaining occurrences). Maintain those products for k<=the running minimum frequency, shrinking the vector as v increases. Each binomial tail takes O(cnt[v]) to build and each product update O(prefixMin), with prefixMin<=cnt[v], so total O(n) after factorial precomputation. Stop at the first absent value. O(n) time and memory.',r'''#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;using ll=long long;const ll P=998244353;ll pw(ll a,ll e){ll r=1;for(;e;e>>=1,a=a*a%P)if(e&1)r=r*a%P;return r;}int main(){ios::sync_with_stdio(false);cin.tie(nullptr);int Z=200005;vector<ll>fac(Z,1),inv(Z,1),two(Z,1);for(int i=1;i<Z;i++){fac[i]=fac[i-1]*i%P;two[i]=two[i-1]*2%P;}inv.back()=pw(fac.back(),P-2);for(int i=Z-1;i;i--)inv[i-1]=inv[i]*i%P;int t;cin>>t;while(t--){int n;cin>>n;vector<int>c(n);for(int i=0,x;i<n;i++){cin>>x;c[x]++;}vector<ll>prod(n+1,1);int lim=n,remaining=n;ll ans=0;for(int x=0;x<n&&c[x];x++){int f=c[x];remaining-=f;lim=min(lim,f);vector<ll>tail(f+2);for(int j=f;j>=0;j--)tail[j]=(tail[j+1]+fac[f]*inv[j]%P*inv[f-j])%P;ll contribution=0;for(int k=1;k<=lim;k++){prod[k]=prod[k]*tail[k]%P;contribution=(contribution+prod[k])%P;}ans=(ans+contribution*two[remaining])%P;}cout<<ans<<'\n';}}'''),
('2030/F','An array can be erased exactly when it has no alternating occurrences x,y,x,y for x!=y: crossing color spans force incompatible removal order; without crossings the nested/disjoint spans can be removed inside-out. Let prev[i] be previous occurrence. Any crossing can be represented by a consecutive x pair p,r and y occurrences a,q with a<p<q<r (choose the first y after p). Thus at r query the largest prev[q]<p among p<q<r. A static merge-sort tree on prev supports this range predecessor query. Prefix maxima of the resulting forbidden left endpoints describe all crossings within each prefix. Query [l,r] is valid iff l exceeds that prefix maximum. O((n+q)log^2 n) time, O(n log n) space.',r'''#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;struct Tree{int n;vector<vector<int>>tr;Tree(vector<int>&a):n(a.size()),tr(4*n){build(1,0,n-1,a);}void build(int v,int l,int r,vector<int>&a){if(l==r){tr[v]={a[l]};return;}int m=(l+r)/2;build(v*2,l,m,a);build(v*2+1,m+1,r,a);merge(tr[v*2].begin(),tr[v*2].end(),tr[v*2+1].begin(),tr[v*2+1].end(),back_inserter(tr[v]));}int get(int v,int l,int r,int ql,int qr,int bound){if(ql>r||qr<l)return -1;if(ql<=l&&r<=qr){auto it=lower_bound(tr[v].begin(),tr[v].end(),bound);return it==tr[v].begin()?-1:*--it;}int m=(l+r)/2;return max(get(v*2,l,m,ql,qr,bound),get(v*2+1,m+1,r,ql,qr,bound));}};int main(){ios::sync_with_stdio(false);cin.tie(nullptr);int t;cin>>t;while(t--){int n,q;cin>>n>>q;vector<int>last(n+1,-1),prev(n),bad(n,-1);for(int i=0,x;i<n;i++){cin>>x;prev[i]=last[x];last[x]=i;}Tree st(prev);for(int r=0;r<n;r++){if(r)bad[r]=bad[r-1];int p=prev[r];if(p>=0&&p+1<r)bad[r]=max(bad[r],st.get(1,0,n-1,p+1,r-1,p));}while(q--){int l,r;cin>>l>>r;--l;--r;cout<<(l>bad[r]?"YES":"NO")<<'\n';}}}'''),
('2001/A','At least n-maxFrequency deletions are needed because the final equal value must retain only its original copies. Fix a most frequent value. If any other value remains, an allowed nondecreasing adjacent pair with a deletable non-target endpoint exists: otherwise every boundary involving a non-target would be strictly decreasing, impossible around a cyclic interval between two target copies (or around the full cycle). Delete that endpoint and repeat, never deleting a target. Hence n-maxFrequency is attainable. O(n) time and memory.',r'''#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;int main(){int t;cin>>t;while(t--){int n;cin>>n;vector<int>f(n+1);int best=0;for(int i=0,x;i<n;i++){cin>>x;best=max(best,++f[x]);}cout<<n-best<<'\n';}}''')]
